      "source_sanskrit": "गृत्समद उवाच । भृगोर्वचनमाकर्ण्य लज्जितश्च्यवनोऽभवत् । तं प्रणम्य महाभक्त्या प्रपच्छ स कृतांजलिः ॥१॥",
      "text": "ಗೃತ್ಸಮದನು ಹೇಳಿದನು: ಭೃಗುವಿನ ಮಾತನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿ ಚ್ಯವನನು ಲಜ್ಜಿತನಾದನು; ಅವನು ಕೈಮುಗಿದುಕೊಂಡು ಮಹಾಭಕ್ತಿಯಿಂದ ಅವನಿಗೆ ನಮಸ್ಕರಿಸಿ ಹೀಗೆ ಕೇಳಿದನು. ॥೧॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        2
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "च्यवन उवाच । क्षमस्व मेऽपराधं च यत्कृतं सर्जनं मया । मदस्य भागहीनौ तावश्विनौ भागसंयुतौ ॥२॥",
      "text": "ಚ್ಯವನನು ಹೇಳಿದನು: ಹವಿರ್ಭಾಗವಿಲ್ಲದಿದ್ದ ಆ ಇಬ್ಬರು ಅಶ್ವಿನೀದೇವತೆಗಳನ್ನು ಹವಿರ್ಭಾಗವುಳ್ಳವರನ್ನಾಗಿ ಮಾಡುವಲ್ಲಿ ನನ್ನಿಂದ ಮದನ ಸೃಷ್ಟಿಯೆಂಬ ಯಾವ ಕಾರ್ಯವು ಮಾಡಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತೋ, ನನ್ನ ಆ ಅಪರಾಧವನ್ನು ಕ್ಷಮಿಸು. ॥೨॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        3
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "अधुना गणनाथस्य ज्ञानं मे वद शांतिदम् । मदादिकं समुत्सृज्य येन शांतो भवाम्यहम् ॥३॥",
      "text": "ಈಗ ಮದವೇ ಮೊದಲಾದವುಗಳನ್ನು ಸಂಪೂರ್ಣವಾಗಿ ತೊರೆದು ನಾನು ಯಾವುದರಿಂದ ಶಾಂತನಾಗುವೆನೋ, ಶಾಂತಿಯನ್ನು ನೀಡುವಂತಹ ಆ ಗಣನಾಥನ ಜ್ಞಾನವನ್ನು ನನಗೆ ಹೇಳು. ॥೩॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        4
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "गृत्समद उवाच । तदीयं वाक्यमाकर्ण्य भृगुस्तं प्राह सिद्धिदम् । योगं पूर्णं गणेशाख्यं तं शृणुष्व वदाम्यहम् ॥ ४ ॥",
      "text": "ಗೃತ್ಸಮದನು ಹೇಳಿದನು: ಅವನ ಆ ಮಾತನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿ ಭೃಗುವು ಅವನಿಗೆ ಸಿದ್ಧಿದಾಯಕವಾದ ಹಾಗೂ ಪೂರ್ಣವಾದ 'ಗಣೇಶ' ಎಂಬ ಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಹೇಳಿದನು; ನಾನು ಅದನ್ನು ಹೇಳುತ್ತೇನೆ, ಕೇಳು. ॥ ೪ ॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        5
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "भृगुरुवाच । गणेशो ब्रह्मरूपोऽयं पूर्णशांतिमयः स्मृतः । भेदाभेदादियोगेन गणेशः प्राप्यते नरैः ॥५॥",
      "text": "ಭೃಗುವು ಹೇಳಿದನು: ಬ್ರಹ್ಮರೂಪನಾದ ಈ ಗಣೇಶನು ಪೂರ್ಣಶಾಂತಿಮಯನೆಂದು ಸ್ಮರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿದ್ದಾನೆ; ಭೇದಾಭೇದವೇ ಮೊದಲಾದ ಯೋಗದಿಂದ ಮನುಷ್ಯರಿಂದ ಗಣೇಶನು ಪಡೆಯಲ್ಪಡುತ್ತಾನೆ. ॥೫॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        6
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "मायामयमिदं सर्वं भेदाभेदमयं सुत । त्यक्त्वा गणेश्वरत्वेन न चित्तं संभवेत् कदा ॥६॥",
      "text": "ಮಗನೇ! ಮಾಯಾಮಯವಾದ ಮತ್ತು ಭೇದಾಭೇದಮಯವಾದ ಈ ಎಲ್ಲವನ್ನೂ ತೊರೆದು, ಗಣೇಶ್ವರಭಾವದಿಂದ ಚಿತ್ತವು ಯಾವಾಗ ಉದಯಿಸುವುದಿಲ್ಲವೋ, ॥೬॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        7
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "तदा चित्तस्य वृत्तीनां पंचानां नाश एव च । जायते नाऽत्र संदेहो योगशांतिमयो भवेत् ॥७॥",
      "text": "ಆಗ ಚಿತ್ತದ ಐದು ವೃತ್ತಿಗಳ ನಾಶವುಂಟಾಗುತ್ತದೆ ಮತ್ತು ಸಾಧಕನು ಯೋಗಶಾಂತಿಮಯನಾಗುತ್ತಾನೆ; ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ಸಂದೇಹವಿಲ್ಲ. ॥೭॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        8
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "अतस्त्वं गणराजं तं भज योगस्य सेवया । मयोक्तेन विधानेन शांतियुक्तो भविष्यसि ॥८॥",
      "text": "ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನೀನು ಯೋಗದ ಸೇವೆಯಿಂದ ಆ ಗಣರಾಜನನ್ನು ಭಜಿಸು; ನನ್ನಿಂದ ಹೇಳಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ವಿಧಾನದಿಂದ ನೀನು ಶಾಂತಿಯುಕ್ತನಾಗುವೆ. ॥೮॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        9
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "इत्युक्त्वा विररामाऽथ भृगुः शांतिसमन्वितः । तं प्रणम्य ययौ सोऽपि च्यवनः परामाहृतः ॥९॥",
      "text": "ಶಾಂತಿಯಿಂದ ಕೂಡಿದ ಭೃಗುವು ಹೀಗೆ ಹೇಳಿ ವಿರಮಿಸಿದನು; ಆ ಚ್ಯವನನೂ ಸಹ ಪರಮವಾಗಿ ಆಹೃತನಾಗಿ (ಆಕೃಷ್ಟಚಿತ್ತನಾಗಿ) ಅವನಿಗೆ ನಮಸ್ಕರಿಸಿ ತೆರಳಿದನು. ॥೯॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        10
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "वने गत्वा तपस्तप्तं तेन योगप्रदायकम् । क्रमेण चित्तभूमीनां शोधनं च कृतं बलात् ॥१०॥",
      "text": "ಕಾಡಿಗೆ ಹೋಗಿ ಅವನಿಂದ ಯೋಗಪ್ರದಾಯಕವಾದ ತಪಸ್ಸು ಆಚರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು ಮತ್ತು ಕ್ರಮವಾಗಿ ಬಲದಿಂದ ಚಿತ್ತಭೂಮಿಗಳ ಶೋಧನೆಯೂ ಮಾಡಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು. ॥೧೦॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        11
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "शमश्चैव दमस्तेन सेवितौ भूमिनाशनात् । सर्वं सुसुलभं प्राप्तं ततो ब्रह्मविचारतः ॥११॥",
      "text": "ಚಿತ್ತಭೂಮಿಗಳ ನಾಶದಿಂದ ಅವನಿಂದ ಶಮ ಮತ್ತು ದಮಗಳು ಸೇವಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟವು; ತದನಂತರ ಬ್ರಹ್ಮವಿಚಾರದಿಂದ ಎಲ್ಲವೂ ಅತ್ಯಂತ ಸುಲಭವಾಗಿ ಪ್ರಾಪ್ತವಾಯಿತು. ॥೧೧॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentlanguage/contextreviewall45units43colophonand2invocations;pixelverificationintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        43,
        12
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p39",
      "source_sanskrit": "शांतियोगं समासाद्य तदाकारेण संस्थितः । गणेशमभजन्नित्यं गाणपत्यस्वभावतः ॥१२॥",
      "text": "ಶಾಂತಿಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಪಡೆದು ತದಾಕಾರವಾಗಿ ನೆಲೆಸಿದವನಾಗಿ, ಅವನು ಗಾಣಪತ್ಯಸ್ವಭಾವದಿಂದ ಪ್ರತಿನಿತ್ಯವೂ ಗಣೇಶನನ್ನು ಭಜಿಸಿದನು. ॥೧೨॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
